  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f7f100ca5acb80e419fb880c74681589, type: 3}
  m_Name: TaurusDialogue2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueList:
  - 'Oh, hey, you made it. '
  - And yes, I'm gonna be at all the info desks.
  - I'm the only one that mans them. The signs don't care enough.
  - Anyways, good job on surviving the second maze.
  - 'Nice moves. '
  - The next maze is a bit more tricky.
  - Company policy forbids me from telling you anything else.
  - I don't know why we have it when the signs ignore it, anyway.
  - They're just like 'Look at me! I'm a sign! Let me tell you things!'
  - Anyways, you'll be needing this.
  - You can now turn your flashlight on & off with left click.
  - Whatever that means.
  - Happy trails.
